Sources/SiftCore/Providers/SparkleAppcast.swift (SparkleVersion) is a Swift port of
Sparkle's version comparator, Sparkle/SUStandardVersionComparator.m, from
Sparkle (https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle): the 2.x branch as read on 2026-10-25
(head 0c8c6f27579bae4b18e1799c4ed7cd4aeefa66f9 on 2026-10-26) and tag 1.26.0
(c0933a516b420806e9216e71bd13ba76c54f0de6). Modifications: rewritten in Swift
over Unicode scalars, with Sparkle 1's unpadded comparison as an option.
